test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4313862Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4314225Z                         goal.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4314560Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4314933Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4315603Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4316003Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4316400Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4316820Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4317153Z                         field solution.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4317510Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4318055Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4318444Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4318886Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4319253Z                         local solver jobs.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4319572Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4319949Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4320372Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4320794Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4321167Z                         not manufacturability.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4321537Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4321960Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4322315Z                         processor works.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4322665Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4323071Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4323420Z                         parameters.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4323789Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4324208Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4324613Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4325022Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4325478Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4325894Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4326457Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4326838Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4327261Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.4327630Z                         no EM extraction.
