test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6735800Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6736200Z                         goal.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6736520Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6736900Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6737300Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6737710Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6738800Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6739670Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6740980Z                         field solution.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6742210Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6743170Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6744090Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6745270Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6746100Z                         local solver jobs.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6746850Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6747750Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6748710Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6750130Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6751090Z                         not manufacturability.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6751930Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6752970Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6753740Z                         processor works.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6754690Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6755620Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6756540Z                         parameters.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6757560Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6758610Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6759700Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6760110Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6760490Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6760890Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6762310Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6762840Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6763320Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
test (macos-14, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:01.6763720Z                         no EM extraction.
