test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.1055186Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.1055761Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
