test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.1058118Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.1058784Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.1059460Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.1060027Z                         not manufacturability.
