test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1933553Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1933979Z                         goal.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1934606Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1935079Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1935726Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1936046Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1936387Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1936742Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1937035Z                         field solution.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1937350Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1937676Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1937998Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1938376Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1938725Z                         local solver jobs.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1938986Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1939295Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1939641Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1940003Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1940301Z                         not manufacturability.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1940607Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1940963Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1941255Z                         processor works.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1941552Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1941889Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1942164Z                         parameters.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1942476Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1942825Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1943163Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1943505Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1943864Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1944210Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1944894Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1945221Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1945585Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
test (ubuntu-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:49:51.1945903Z                         no EM extraction.
